u-at-wangjingwens-death:p002","quote":"景文","mention_id":"c-nanqishu-030-jiaodu-at-wangjingwens-death:p002:m0016"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-008","source_id":"s-songshu-008-wangjingwen-death-annal-ws2309997","chapter_id":"c-songshu-008-wangjingwen-death-annal","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-008-wangjingwen-death-annal:p001","quote":"王景文","mention_id":"c-songshu-008-wangjingwen-death-annal:p001:m0026"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"本輪固定原段的來源身份；字、王號、引古人物及同名候選依各自上下文判讀，正式對讀、親屬與稱號另存。孔尚具名另見宋93；甯越勤學故事不按同名強接過秦論候選。"},{"id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_D","label":"王彧姊（宋書載墓開，未名）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p004","quote":"姊","kind":"person_reference","mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p004:r0047"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"孝武時已卒；明帝妻王貞風是景文妹，另有生前事蹟，非姊。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_siblings","sibling_assertion_ids":["a-nan023-wangyu-deceased-sister"],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-nan023-wangyu-shenglang"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p004","quote":"上以散騎常侍舊與侍中俱掌獻替，欲高其選，以景文及會稽孔覬俱南北之望以補之。尋復為司徒左長史。以姊墓開不臨赴，免官。後拜侍中、領射聲校尉、左衛將軍，加給事中、太子中庶子。坐與奉朝請毛法因蒱戲得錢百二十萬，白衣領職。","subject_person_reference_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p004:r0047","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p004:m0021","source_term":"姊墓開","source_assertion_id":"a-nan023-wangyu-deceased-sister"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p001","quote":"王彧字景文，球從子也。祖穆字伯遠，司徒謐之長兄，位臨海太守。父僧朗，仕宋位尚書右僕射，明帝初，以後父加特進，贈開府儀同三司，諡元公。彧名與明帝諱同，故以字行。伯父智少簡貴，有高名，宋武帝甚重之。常言：「見王智使人思仲祖」。武帝與劉穆之討劉毅而智在焉，他日，穆之白武帝曰：「伐國重事，公言何乃使王智知。」武帝笑曰：「此人高簡，豈聞此輩論議。」其見知如此。為宋國五兵尚書，封建陵縣五等子，追贈太常。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p001:m0031","source_term":"父僧朗","source_assertion_id":"a-nan023-wangyu-shenglang"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"從具名生父與傳主之姊組裝。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[],"most_mentioned_source_ids":[],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-nan023-wangyu-deceased-sister","subject_person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_D","object_person_id":"1tc_q18_x7v","predicate":"sister","qualifiers":{"source_term":"姊墓開","nan023_wangyu_reading":"deceased-sister","relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_D","younger_person_id":"1tc_q18_x7v","operator":"lt","scope":"siblings","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p004","quote":"上以散騎常侍舊與侍中俱掌獻替，欲高其選，以景文及會稽孔覬俱南北之望以補之。尋復為司徒左長史。以姊墓開不臨赴，免官。後拜侍中、領射聲校尉、左衛將軍，加給事中、太子中庶子。坐與奉朝請毛法因蒱戲得錢百二十萬，白衣領職。","subject_person_reference_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p004:r0047","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p004:m0021"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"親稱具體兩端與長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 